{"id":"a07a3ec2073ac7ee","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism.md","title":"Curry-Howard Isomorphism","display":"thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry-Howard Isomorphism","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism","aliases":["72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism"],"display":"thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry-Howard Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[72-df-curry-howard]]","[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, §3.2 print15–17 and §11.6 print93","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry-Howard Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, §3.2 print15–17 and §11.6 print93"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-curry-howard-isomorphism-—-Curry–Howard-Isomorphism\">thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry–Howard Isomorphism</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\">\\(s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_s,\\operatorname{CH},J,\\approx_s\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_s,\\operatorname{CH},J,\\approx_s\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)=\\{M:\\Gamma\\vdash_sM:A\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)=\\{M:\\Gamma\\vdash_sM:A\\}\\)</span>。以下关系仅取同一类型、同一上下文的两端。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 遍历对应项语法的合法单孔context；自由变量函数及β关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_{\\beta\\eta,s}\">\\(=_{\\beta\\eta,s}\\)</span> 的反身传递闭包以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 为载体，其零次关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\}\\)</span>；不在未定的全部未类型化项上加恒等关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\eta_s^0&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[\\lambda x:A.Mx],C[M]\\rangle:x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M[U]],C[M]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\},\\\\\n\\eta_s&amp;:=\\eta_s^0\\cap(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\times\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)),\\\\\n\\widehat\\beta_s&amp;:=\\beta_s\\cap\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)^2,\\\\\n=_{\\beta\\eta,s}&amp;:=(\\widehat\\beta_s\\cup\\eta_s\\cup\\widehat\\beta_s^{-1}\\cup\\eta_s^{-1})^*,\\qquad\\beta_\\to:=\\beta_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\forall d\\in\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\quad&amp;J(\\operatorname{CH}(d))=d\\land\\operatorname{CH}(d)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\n\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\quad&amp;\\operatorname{CH}(J(M))=M\\land J(M)\\in\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\nd\\approx_s e&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CH}(d)=_{\\beta\\eta,s}\\operatorname{CH}(e),\\\\\n\\overline{\\operatorname{CH}}_s([d]_{\\approx_s})&amp;:=[\\operatorname{CH}(d)]_{=_{\\beta\\eta,s}},\\\\\n\\overline{\\operatorname{CH}}_s:\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)/{\\approx_s}&amp;\\ \\xrightarrow{\\cong}\\ \\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)/{=_{\\beta\\eta,s}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\eta_s^0&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[\\lambda x:A.Mx],C[M]\\rangle:x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M[U]],C[M]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\},\\\\\n\\eta_s&amp;:=\\eta_s^0\\cap(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\times\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)),\\\\\n\\widehat\\beta_s&amp;:=\\beta_s\\cap\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)^2,\\\\\n=_{\\beta\\eta,s}&amp;:=(\\widehat\\beta_s\\cup\\eta_s\\cup\\widehat\\beta_s^{-1}\\cup\\eta_s^{-1})^*,\\qquad\\beta_\\to:=\\beta_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\forall d\\in\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\quad&amp;J(\\operatorname{CH}(d))=d\\land\\operatorname{CH}(d)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\n\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\quad&amp;\\operatorname{CH}(J(M))=M\\land J(M)\\in\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\nd\\approx_s e&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CH}(d)=_{\\beta\\eta,s}\\operatorname{CH}(e),\\\\\n\\overline{\\operatorname{CH}}_s([d]_{\\approx_s})&amp;:=[\\operatorname{CH}(d)]_{=_{\\beta\\eta,s}},\\\\\n\\overline{\\operatorname{CH}}_s:\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)/{\\approx_s}&amp;\\ \\xrightarrow{\\cong}\\ \\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)/{=_{\\beta\\eta,s}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由树构造归纳逐规则检查互逆，再逐个β、η生成元检查对应，故商映射良定义且双射。第二阶版本量化命题变量，不能表述成任意第二阶一阶对象逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-curry-howard-isomorphism-—-Curry–Howard-Isomorphism","text":"thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry–Howard Isomorphism","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-curry-howard]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；$\\operatorname{Der}_s,\\operatorname{CH},J,\\approx_s$ 使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]]；$\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)=\\{M:\\Gamma\\vdash_sM:A\\}$。以下关系仅取同一类型、同一上下文的两端。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$ 遍历对应项语法的合法单孔context；自由变量函数及β关系见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Der}_s,\\operatorname{CH},J,\\approx_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)=\\{M:\\Gamma\\vdash_sM:A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"=_{\\beta\\eta,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\eta_s^0&:=\\{\\langle C[\\lambda x:A.Mx],C[M]\\rangle:x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M[U]],C[M]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\},\\\\\n\\eta_s&:=\\eta_s^0\\cap(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\times\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)),\\\\\n\\widehat\\beta_s&:=\\beta_s\\cap\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)^2,\\\\\n=_{\\beta\\eta,s}&:=(\\widehat\\beta_s\\cup\\eta_s\\cup\\widehat\\beta_s^{-1}\\cup\\eta_s^{-1})^*,\\qquad\\beta_\\to:=\\beta_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\forall d\\in\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\quad&J(\\operatorname{CH}(d))=d\\land\\operatorname{CH}(d)\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\n\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\quad&\\operatorname{CH}(J(M))=M\\land J(M)\\in\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\nd\\approx_s e&\\longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CH}(d)=_{\\beta\\eta,s}\\operatorname{CH}(e),\\\\\n\\overline{\\operatorname{CH}}_s([d]_{\\approx_s})&:=[\\operatorname{CH}(d)]_{=_{\\beta\\eta,s}},\\\\\n\\overline{\\operatorname{CH}}_s:\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)/{\\approx_s}&\\ \\xrightarrow{\\cong}\\ \\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)/{=_{\\beta\\eta,s}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2741,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-392","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism|thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry-Howard Isomorphism]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-390","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry-Howard Isomorphism](72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-426","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism|thm-curry-howard-isomorphism — Curry-Howard Isomorphism]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-430","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["4628a763a7cdff3f","3cb0b5b1c6108aea"]}